1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
烤之前，先给鸭子吹口气
First, blow air into the duck

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,400
空气钻进皮和肉之间
Air slips between skin and meat

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,600
皮肉一分离，才能烤脆
Separated, the skin can crisp up

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,800
挂炉派：果木明火烤
Hung-oven style: open fruitwood fire

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:10,900
全聚德，1864年
Quanjude, since 1864

6
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:13,100
焖炉派：不见明火
Closed-oven style: no open flame

7
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:15,300
便宜坊，早它四百多年
Bianyifang, 400+ years older

8
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:17,500
皮烤成枣红透亮
Skin roasted glossy jujube-red

9
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:19,600
一只鸭，片成108片
One duck, sliced 108 times

10
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:21,800
片片带皮带肉
Each slice: skin and meat together

11
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:24,000
你蘸甜面酱，还是白糖？
Sweet bean sauce, or sugar?

12
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,300
下集完结：一块豆腐，切几千根丝
Finale: tofu cut into 1,000 threads
